h evidence-method quality."}},"exam_09_B_case3_q1":{"answer":{"value":0.7703703703703704,"unit":"ratio","abs_tolerance":0.002311111111111111},"rubric":{},"explanation":{"fr":"1. CPI = 104000/135000 = 0.7704.\n2. SPI = 104000/125000 = 0.832.\n3. EAC = 600000/0.7704 ≈ 778846.1538 €.\n4. CPI < 1 indique un coût supérieur au budget de la valeur acquise ; SPI ne prouve pas la date finale.\n\nLe forecast suppose la poursuite de l’efficacité de coût observée.","en":"1. CPI = 104000/135000 = 0.7704.\n2. SPI = 104000/125000 = 0.832.\n3. EAC = 600000/0.7704 ≈ €778846.1538.\n4. CPI < 1 indicates earned work cost more than its budget; SPI does not establish completion date.\n\nForecast assumes observed cost efficiency continues."}},"exam_09_B_case3_q2":{"answer":{"value":0.832,"unit":"ratio","abs_tolerance":0.002496},"rubric":{},"explanation":{"fr":"1. CPI = 104000/135000 = 0.7704.\n2. SPI = 104000/125000 = 0.832.\n3. EAC = 600000/0.7704 ≈ 778846.1538 €.\n4. CPI < 1 indique un coût supérieur au budget de la valeur acquise ; SPI ne prouve pas la date finale.\n\nLe forecast suppose la poursuite de l’efficacité de coût observée.","en":"1. CPI = 104000/135000 = 0.7704.\n2. SPI = 104000/125000 = 0.832.\n3. EAC = 600000/0.7704 ≈ €778846.1538.\n4. CPI < 1 indicates earned work cost more than its budget; SPI does not establish completion date.\n\nForecast assumes observed cost efficiency continues."}},"exam_09_B_case3_q3":{"answer":{"value":778846.1538461539,"unit":"€","abs_tolerance":2336.538461538462},"rubric":{},"explanation":{"fr":"1. CPI = 104000/135000 = 0.7704.\n2. SPI = 104000/125000 = 0.832.\n3. EAC = 600000/0.7704 ≈ 778846.1538 €.\n4. CPI < 1 indique un coût supérieur au budget de la valeur acquise ; SPI ne prouve pas la date finale.\n\nLe forecast suppose la poursuite de l’efficacité de coût observée.","en":"1. CPI = 104000/135000 = 0.7704.\n2. SPI = 104000/125000 = 0.832.\n3. EAC = 600000/0.7704 ≈ €778846.1538.\n4. CPI < 1 indicates earned work cost more than its budget; SPI does not establish completion date.\n\nForecast assumes observed cost efficiency continues."}},"exam_09_B_case3_decision":{"answer":{"choice_id":"exam_09_B_case3_decision_c1"},"rubric":{},"explanation":{"fr":"Analyser les livrables acquis, le chemin critique et l’hypothèse de forecast avant de décider. Le forecast suppose la poursuite de l’efficacité de coût observée.","en":"Examine earned deliverables, critical path and forecast assumptions before deciding. Forecast assumes observed cost efficiency continues."}}}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
